          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba eege worri Israeli garagale, kara Bashani deemu gula yae; jennaani hayyu Oguni ka lafa Bashani gabahe, duula ufi fud'ate, aka Edreti worra had'u kurfefate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo AABBO Waaqi waan Musani jed'e, Isa insodaatini, anini isaafi worra isaatiifi lafa isaale harka keesaniti kenna. Waan atini Sioni, hayyu Amori, ka Heshboni tau, tolchite isale tolchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 21:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duuba worri Israeli Ogufi ilmaani isaatiifi worra isaa ch'ufa, ka nama tokole inhambisini, fit'e. Duuba eege lafa isaani fud'ate.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.21.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.21.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
